      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Dany is a sligthly famous figure in the local gym,\neven tho it's not
    the best fighter, his trainer is convinced\nthat it has what it takes to became
    the regional champion.\n\nHis coach is always happy to let the new ones \nfight
    against Dany so they can introduce themselves\nin the minor leagues. "
